	<summary>
		<band height="213">
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="0" y="0" width="551" height="20" uuid="f26b6b6b-bb63-4b21-b7fb-a3b88e1c5546"/>
				<textElement textAlignment="Center">
					<font isBold="true" isItalic="true" isUnderline="false"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[Notice]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="0" y="0" width="551" height="137" uuid="dc26425d-297e-4b7c-bb76-65c2e31020cf"/>
				<textElement textAlignment="Center"/>
				<text><![CDATA[

Payment should be made at the Land and Surveys Divisional Office, and should be accompanied by this Notice. Cheques and Drafts should be made payable to "Sarawak Government" and crossed. They should not be made payable to any individual officer.

Office Hours: Monday to Thursday : 8:00 a.m. to 12 noon and 2:00 p.m. to 3:00 p.m.
                                             Friday : 8:00 a.m. to 11 a.m. and 2:15 p.m. to 3:00 p.m.

PLEASE PRODUCE THIS FORM INTACT AT TIME OF PAYMENT. It will be returned with the receipt machine-printed.]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<componentElement>
				<reportElement mode="Opaque" x="216" y="145" width="113" height="21" forecolor="#000000" backcolor="#FFFFFF" uuid="9f6a6dfa-d2b8-4021-868a-110fc5273936"/>
